    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25510" root="ضبع" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنَّا فِى ضُبْعِ فُلَانٍ</span></b>  (S, O, K) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فلان</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَبْعِ</span></b> 
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فلان</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِبْعِ</span></b>  (K) <i>We were in the protection,</i>
or <i>quarter,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَنَف</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاحِيَة</span>,) <i>of such a one.</i> (S,
O, K: but in the K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ</span> is put in the place of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنَّا</span>.)

